{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_53","type":"agent_message","text":"The remaining concerns are in cases the focused tests don’t cover: selected mandatory-human overlays, history inferred from `status: done`, and receipt verification that compares member identities but ignores the recorded subject digest. I’m also checking whether doctor and attention distinguish a valid terminal receipt from one that no longer stands."}}
